Windows Registry Editor Version 5.00

; Winnow fixture: GOG's per-game install registry, 32-bit view.
; Real key path on Windows: HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\SOFTWARE\WOW6432Node\GOG.com\Games\<gameID>
; Captured from a live install and lightly sanitized (BUILDID kept, it is public).
; Note gameName/startMenu carry the INSTALLER-LOCALE title (Polish here), not the
; canonical store title -- see docs/spikes/epic-gog-local-files.md section 6.

